  "2026-10-05T06:12:54.232Z",codex-sol,"TDD plan: add adversarial synthetic secret and clean text tests for expect false, default and explicit true, invalid expect rejection before inference, and inclusive p == threshold behavior. Gate predicates and exit codes must use full precision before output rounding. Record commands before implementation."
  "2026-10-05T06:16:10.375Z",codex-sol,"Red phase: linked node --test test/agent-ux.test.ts failed as expected because holds/expected/ok were absent. Host-linked test result tracking is disabled, so explicit PM comments carry the red/green receipts."
  "2026-10-05T06:18:50.331Z",codex-sol,"Green phase: linked agent UX tests pass. Local npm run test:live passed all 7 decisions: triage, dedupe, mixed ask, positive default gate, negative default gate, secret expect false gate (p=0.9586815127864688, exit 1) and clean expect false gate (p=0.11993540918170091, exit 0). No item mutation."
  "2026-10-05T06:23:47.039Z",codex-sol,"Verification complete: 88/88 tests pass with all-source coverage 100/100/100/100. Local tev1 live acceptance and actual packed-host safety CLI acceptance pass; secret expect false exits 1, clean exits 0. Inclusive boundaries and full-precision verdicts are tested. README and docs/agent-ux-validation.md carry the semantics and receipts; rebuilt dist is included. Item remains in progress for orchestrator review."
